The alignscore.txt file in this release was generated by
generate_alignscore.py from the BLOSUM62 scoring values published by NCBI.

NCBI source:
https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/IEB/ToolBox/CPP_DOC/lxr/source/src/util/tables/sm_blosum62.c

NCBI source authors: Aaron Ucko and Mike Gertz.
The NCBI source identifies this material as a United States Government Work
and states that its use and reproduction are unrestricted.

The script formats the scores for GenBlastG and sets gap opening to -11
and gap extension to -1.
